From b88dfab55ff02cd1d0133e7d83d80d73807e5dc3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 18:20:38 -0700
Subject: 035-add-asio-coroutine-rpc-dispatcher-and-longpoll-migration: add
 Boost.Asio coroutine HTTP/RPC dispatcher and migrate waitfor*/GBT
 long-polling

Adds stackless C++20 coroutine HTTP/RPC dispatch (AsyncRPCMethodImpl) and
event-driven AsyncLongPollWaiter for waitforblock, waitforblockheight,
waitfornewblock, and getblocktemplate longpollid with co-located unit tests.
